~ start
set voice_pitch = 1.0
if not player_clothed
	Nicky Nibbles: Sorry mista! Ma says I can't sells to naked dinos anymore!
	Nicky Nibbles: Somethin' about not knowin' where they're keeping their change.
	=> END 

if not nibbles_encountered
	=> first_encounter
	
if has_coin:
	Nicky Nibbles: Wowee mista! That sure is a soggy coin ya got there!
	Nicky Nibbles: I'm not even sure it's a coin what with how it's covered in so much filth and grime!
	Nicky Nibbles: Where'd ya find this coin, in the sewer? 
	Nicky Nibbles: I mean [wave]goooo-lllyyy![/wave] 
	Nicky Nibbles: This has got to be the most digustin' piece of currency I've ever laid my 10 year old eyes on!
	Nicky Nibbles: Gee whillikers, it smells like the bottom of a boot after a rainy day parade!
	Nicky Nibbles: I betcha this thing’s seen more rats than a butcher’s alley!
	Nicky Nibbles: Honest to gosh, you'd think a dead liopleurodon hawked this thing up!
	Nicky Nibbles: Look, it’s still drippin’! I think it winked at me!
	Nicky Nibbles: My ma always tells me, "Don’t touch strange coins what smell like cabbage," and here I am breakin’ the rules!
	Nicky Nibbles: If I press my ear to it, I swear I can hear the sewer gators singin’!
	Nicky Nibbles: Holy moly, this coin’s so slimy I could fry it up like an egg!
	Nicky Nibbles: I seen garbage trucks cleaner than this here coin!
	Nicky Nibbles: Whew, mister, you sure you ain’t tryin’ to pay me with some kinda cursed swamp token?
	Nicky Nibbles: I mean geez Louise, I’m gonna have to wash my claws in vinegar for a week after touchin’ this thing!
	Nicky Nibbles: ...
	Nicky Nibbles: Anywho here's ya snacks.
	do reveal_item("DinoSnacks")
	do remove_item("Coin")
	set has_coin = false
	set has_candy = true
	=> END!

Nicky Nibbles: Dino [wave]snaaaacks[/wave]! Get ya dino snacks [wave]heeeeere[/wave]! 
Nicky Nibbles: One penny a bag!
	

=> END

~ first_encounter
Nicky Nibbles: Hiya mista! 
Nicky Nibbles: 'Round these parts they call me [wave]Nicky Nibbles![/wave] 
Nicky Nibbles: Due to lax labor laws I'm workin' 12 hours a day sellin' these here dino snacks despite only being 10 years old!
Nicky Nibbles: Crazy times we live in, am I right?
Nicky Nibbles: Anyway, would you like to buy some of my world famous dino snacks? Family recipe!
Nicky Nibbles: It'll only cost ya one penny!
Nicky Nibbles: It used to cost half a penny, but inflation is [wave]really[/wave] drivin' up prices.
set nibbles_encountered = true
=> END



